    "text": "Combustion of Hydrocarbon,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>for</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>mole</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>of</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>CxHy</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>required</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/